# Rabid Bite (CR 120.3, 609.7): "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control."
# Bot1 casts it on turn 3. The first target must be Bot1's (Bot2's Hill Giant is refused, Alpine Grizzly is chosen), the second Bot2's
# (Bot1's Ornithopter is refused, Bot2's Hill Giant is chosen). Alpine Grizzly (power 4) deals 4 to the Hill Giant (3/3), which dies,
# and takes nothing back: the damage is one-sided, not a fight.

